   171	    - The background is the most frequent color. One non-background color forms diagonal endpoint pairs to be connected. Magenta pixels may lie on those diagonals, and an active magenta trigger carries a tiny neighborhood code: either a red pixel directly above it or a green pixel directly below it.
   172	
