   174	    - Fill each diagonal segment between the extreme same-color endpoints on that diagonal.
   175	    - Whenever the completed segment passes through a magenta trigger, inspect the original input around that trigger: red above selects the upward perpendicular branch, while green below selects the downward perpendicular branch.
   176	    - Emit only that one selected perpendicular diagonal ray until the grid boundary, filling background cells with magenta.
   177	
